      <text:p>Hoffen wir mal, dass dein Kopf diesmal drauf bleibt,&lt;br&gt;damit wir dir nicht alles nochmal beibringen müssen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="49" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>49</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hör zu.&lt;br&gt;Wir sind die *BOMB RUSH CREW*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="50" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>50</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>In dieser Welt geht’s darum, sich einen Namen&lt;br&gt;zu verdienen und dabei Spaß zu haben.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="51" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>51</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Für Respekt brauchst du *REP*.&lt;br&gt;Und für *REP* musst du sprayen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="52" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>52</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>So einfach ist das.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="53" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>53</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Versuch’s mal auf den *Graffiti Spots* hier im Hideout.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="54" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>54</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Spray ein paar Pieces und hol dir mindestens *20 REP*,&lt;br&gt;dann reden wir weiter.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="55" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>55</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Was geht?&lt;br&gt;Spray ein paar Pieces um dir *REP* zu holen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>When asked again</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="56" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>56</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>*20 REP*.&lt;br&gt;Oder auch nicht, deine Entscheidung.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="57" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>57</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Okay okay!&lt;br&gt;Ich seh’ was du kannst!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>when gotten enough REP</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="58" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>58</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ich habe mich entschieden.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="59" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>59</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ich will dich in der Crew.&lt;br&gt;Bist du dabei?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="6"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="60" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>60</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hör zu, Red. Ich habe die&lt;br&gt;BOMB RUSH CREW mit einem Ziel gegründet.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="61" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>61</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Um *All City* zu werden.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro5">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="62" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>62</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Damit meine ich, in allen Teilen von New Amsterdam&lt;br&gt;bekannt zu sein und jede Crew zu besiegen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="63" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>63</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Okay.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>red</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="64" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>64</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Warum brauchst du mich dafür?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="65" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>65</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ich war noch nicht fertig.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="66" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>66</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Dein alter Kopf, sein Name war *Faux*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="67" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>67</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ein unglaublich guter Writer.&lt;br&gt;Sowas hast du noch nie gesehen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="68" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>68</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Einer der *Big 3* von New Amsterdam.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="69" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>69</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mit ihm könnten wir mühelos *All City* werden.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="70" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>70</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Er war bereit, der Crew beizutreten,&lt;br&gt;sobald wir der Polizeistation entkommen...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="71" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>71</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Und ich habe vor, den Deal durchzuziehen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="72" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>72</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Moment mal.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>red</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="73" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>73</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Du sagtest *Faux hat seinen Kopf verloren*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="74" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>74</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Nur sein Körper ist übrig... richtig?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="75" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>75</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ja... und nein.&lt;br&gt;Ich möchte...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="76" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>76</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>dass du dir *deinen Kopf zurück holst*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="77" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>77</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Uhhhmm Tryce.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>bel</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="78" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>78</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Denkst du wirklich, sein Kopf ist... du weißt schon</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="79" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>79</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Noch am Leben?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="80" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>80</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ja. Ich erklär euch warum.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="81" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>81</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>In dieser Nacht... habe ich ihn mit seinen&lt;br&gt;freakigen Augen gesehen. *DJ Cyber*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="82" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>82</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Er ist vom Innenleben des Gehirns besessen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="83" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>83</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Man sagt, er hat eine *spezielle Maschine*,&lt;br&gt;um in die Gedanken seiner Opfer zu sehen...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="84" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>84</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Total verrückt!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="85" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>85</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Und dennoch... ist er der größte DJ in ganz New Amsterdam.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="86" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>86</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ich habe sogar auf sein neues Mixtape gewartet!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="87" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>87</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Also, wenn irgendjemand einen Kopf stehlen&lt;br&gt;und am Leben halten würde... ist es *DJ Cyber*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>bel</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="88" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>88</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Was denkst du Red?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="89" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>89</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>......Ich verstehe. Mein altes ich, Faux... ich...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>red</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="90" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>90</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ich möchte wissen, wer er war...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="91" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>91</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ich möchte meinen Kopf wiederfinden.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="92" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>92</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Siehst du? Er kann es kaum erwarten,&lt;br&gt;sein altes Fleischhirn zurückzubekommen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="93" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>93</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Es ist also beschlossen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="94" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>94</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tryce, du weißt schon.... dass DJ Cyber&lt;br&gt;die mächtigste Crew der Stadt kontrolliert?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>bel</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="95" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>95</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="T11">Das stimmt. Sie nennen sich *FUTURISM</text:span>*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="96" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>96</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Erst neulich haben sie die *FRANKS*&lt;br&gt;in einem Crew-Battle geschlagen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="97" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>97</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>FRANKS sind die größte Crew aus Versum Hill.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="98" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>98</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Die haben alle gemischte Wurzeln,&lt;br&gt;wenn du verstehst, was ich meine.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="99" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>99</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Blasten den ganzen Tag Electro-Funk.&lt;br&gt;Mit denen legt man sich besser nicht an.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="100" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>100</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Aber die können Krawall machen wie sie wollen,&lt;br&gt;DJ Cyber hat dort jetzt das Sagen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro5">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="101" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>101</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Vielleicht können wir diesen Konflikt ausnutzen&lt;br&gt;um den FRANKS Info über DJ Cyber abzulocken.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="102" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>102</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Das sollte unser erster Schritt sein.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="103" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>103</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>In die Richtung liegt das FRANKS Territorium,&lt;br&gt;*Versum Hill*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="104" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>104</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Los geht’s!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="6"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="105" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>105</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Also Red, was hältst du von unserem *Hideout* hier?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce hanging around</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="106" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>106</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Keine anderen Crews oder Polizei. Einfach nur entspannen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="107" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>107</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Aber dafür ist jetzt keine Zeit.&lt;br&gt;Müssen schließlich deinen Kopf zurückbekommen, nicht wahr?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="108" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>108</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Bringen wir die *FRANKS* dazu, uns etwas über den DJ zu erzählen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="6"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="109" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>109</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Heeey, wie gefällt dir das Telefon?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>bel hanging around</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="110" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>110</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Es hat eine super praktische Karte, falls du dich verläufst.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="111" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>111</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Wirf einen Blick drauf, wenn du nicht weißt wohin.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="112" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>112</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Oh ja, einen Moment...</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="113" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>113</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hast du meine Nachricht bekommen?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>after sending text message</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>(downhill stage is Versum Hill)</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="0" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>0</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Sieht aus, als ob die FRANKS hier die Straßen verbarrikadieren.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="1" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>1</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Das ist Versum Hill, keine Frage.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="2" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>2</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Wir teilen uns am besten auf,&lt;br&gt;um nach den FRANKS zu suchen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="6"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="305" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>305</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce98" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Die FRANKS haben hier ganz schön was angerichtet.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>when talking to bel who is skating around</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="306" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>306</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce98" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Ich frage mich, wie wir am besten&lt;br&gt;ihre Aufmerksamkeit bekommen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="6"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="3" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>3</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Für wen hältst du dich, du Toy?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>FRANKS harassing red for covering their graffiti. A ‘toy’ is a graffiti term for a trash newbie. Keep untranslated preferably</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="4" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>4</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Versaust einfach unser Piece hier.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="5" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>5</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Denkst du das ist ein Spiel?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="6" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>6</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Verpiss dich.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="6"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="307" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>307</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce98" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Und... hast du schon FRANKS gesehen?</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>bel</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="308" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>308</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce98" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>.........</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="309" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>309</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce98" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hm, nagut. WENN du welche siehst,&lt;br&gt;folge ihnen. So finden wir den Rest!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce98"/>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="310" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>310</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce98" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Diese FRANKS denken wohl, sie sind besser als wir.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="float" office:value="311" calcext:value-type="float">
      <text:p>311</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce98" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mal sehen ob sie uns ignorieren können,&lt;br&gt;wenn auf allen *Graffiti Spots* BRC steht!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
