     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hältst dich für was ganz großes, Cyberhead?&lt;br&gt;Du hast keine *Wurzeln* wie ich.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Roots is a recurring theme. Ancestral/ethnic origin that the FRANKS’ have heavy emphasis on due to their stitched together bodies </text:p>
