     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>hideout</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Aber wir, die BOMB RUSH CREW, haben uns von unseren&lt;br&gt;bescheidenen Anfängen gelöst und *Versum Hill* ergattert!</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Tryce</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
