     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mall</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Was heute betrifft... sagen wir mal, ich&lt;br&gt;vertrete heute meine eigenen Interessen.</text:p>
