     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Mall</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>...dann werde ich mir wohl was Neues&lt;br&gt;suchen, wo ich der BESTE sein kann...</text:p>
