     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>osaka</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Hier ist eine *Abkürzung durch diese Statue*.&lt;br&gt;Es gibt einen *bestimmten Weg* sie zu öffnen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>he’s hinting that you have to do all the graffiti spots on the palms of the statue. The mouth will then open and a passage will be revealed</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
