    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="ce34" office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTIFICATION_00</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Verdiene mit Graffiti genug *REP*, um die Aufmerksamkeit der *FRANKS* zu bekommen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTIFICATION_JOIN</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>{.} hat sich deiner Crew angeschlossen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>OUTFIT_NOTIFICATION</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Du hast das &apos;{.}&apos; Outfit für {.} gefunden!&lt;br&gt;Finde eine Toilette um dein Outfit zu wechseln.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>MOVESTYLE_NOTIFICATION</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>&apos;{.}&apos; steht jetzt in der&lt;br&gt;{.} Garage zur Verfügung.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>TAXI_UNLOCK_NOTIFICATION</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Du kannst jetzt den *Taxi-Service* benutzen.&lt;br&gt;Drücke [dance] in der Nähe eines *Taxischilds*.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro5">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTIFICATION_DOWNHILL_MAP</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Du kannst dein *Telefon* mit [PhoneMoveRight] öffnen,&lt;br&gt;um zu sehen was auf der *Karte* neu ist.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>Every time you get enough REP to challenge a Frank in Downhill</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>NOTIFICATION_PRELUDE_SKATES</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>*Inlines* erhalten! Benutze [switchStyle],&lt;br&gt;um sie an- oder abzulegen.</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell office:value-type="string" calcext:value-type="string">
      <text:p>In prelude, when you get skates</text:p>
     </table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row table:style-name="ro2">
